{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When night falls, the kingdom\u2019s fate rests on your command.</strong><br>In <strong>Dawn Watcher</strong>, you are the Hero King \u2014 leading loyal warriors against endless enemy waves and monstrous raids that strike under the cover of darkness. Every battle is a clash of counters, formations, and survival tactics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>26 Distinct Units</strong> \u2013 From stealthy scouts to mighty paladins, each with unique abilities and counter mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero Combat</strong> \u2013 Wield powerful skills in real-time battles, challenge enemy commanders, and face a rival King as your final test.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>49 Story Levels</strong> \u2013 Conquer 7 maps, unlock new units, gather rare resources, and endure escalating challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Day &amp; Night</strong> \u2013 Face organized armies by day, and survive sudden monster raids at night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Formations</strong> \u2013 Buy, summon, and arrange troops; combine skills and counters for decisive victories.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign</strong> \u2013 A full story-driven campaign across kingdoms and monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Mode (Planned)</strong> \u2013 Build your own scenarios: choose units, set waves, and test strategies freely.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3631480?t=1758584085","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631480/4440d90195d01072d72a43ac43979fc3947a143e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758584085","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steam